```Title: Domain Trust Discovery (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1482 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 0452775f-affc-47b6-9543-0dedd6b22443```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Administrators and AD health or audit scripts reviewing trusts```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(CommandLine IN ("*/domain_trusts*", "*/all_trusts*", "*/trusted_domains*", "*trustedDomain*", "*Get-ADTrust*", "*Get-DomainTrust*", "*Get-NetDomainTrust*", "*Get-ForestTrust*", "*GetAllTrustRelationships*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
